/* =========================================================================
   i18n.js — interface strings (ES/EN).

   The interface language follows Latent Frontiers' site-wide ES/EN toggle
   (assets/js/lang-toggle.js), which sets <html lang> and stores the choice
   in localStorage['lf-site-lang']. We observe <html lang> instead of adding
   [data-lang] blocks, because the site script hides every [data-lang]
   element that doesn't match. Pedagogical Spanish support inside lessons
   is a separate setting (settings.esSupport).
   ========================================================================= */

